WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.036
Putin refusing to help the

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:05.405
private army, the Wagner group,

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.806
that's according to the chief of

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:09.008
Wagner tonight claiming the

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:11.144
Kremlin will not take his calls

00:00:12.776 --> 00:00:13.276
anymore.

00:00:13.276 --> 00:00:14.845
&gt;&gt; Translator: To get me to stop

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.203
asking for ammunition, all the

00:00:18.203 --> 00:00:19.938
hot lines to offices, to

00:00:33.746 --> 00:00:34.313
departments, et cetera, have

00:00:34.446 --> 00:00:35.815
been cut off from me.

00:00:35.948 --> 00:00:36.549
They've also blocked agencies

00:00:36.682 --> 00:00:39.685
from making decisions.

00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:41.821
&gt;&gt; It's pretty incredible, and

00:00:41.954 --> 00:00:43.088
it could be significant because

00:00:43.189 --> 00:00:46.292
the Wagner group of course is

00:00:46.425 --> 00:00:47.960
responsible for the small

00:00:48.093 --> 00:00:50.162
successes Putin has notched in

00:00:50.296 --> 00:00:51.630
this war.

00:00:51.764 --> 00:00:53.098
The U.N. Estimates at the start

00:00:53.165 --> 00:00:56.135
of this year, there were about

00:00:56.268 --> 00:00:58.370
50,000 Wagner groups fighting.

00:00:58.504 --> 00:00:59.572
But they have been pleading,

00:00:59.705 --> 00:01:03.309
pounding the table, for more

00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:03.942
ammunition almost daily.

00:01:04.043 --> 00:01:05.144
In fact, here they are over just

00:01:05.277 --> 00:01:08.347
the past few days.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:09.381
&gt;&gt; Translator: I'm knocking on

00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:12.184
all doors, sounding the alarm

00:01:12.318 --> 00:01:14.653
with ammunition and

00:01:14.787 --> 00:01:17.122
reenforcements as well as

00:01:17.156 --> 00:01:21.126
covering our flanks.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.728
&gt;&gt; Translator: We are the

00:01:23.128 --> 00:01:23.696
artillery unit.

00:01:23.829 --> 00:01:25.130
Every day we cover assault

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:27.333
groups, at the moment, we are

00:01:27.466 --> 00:01:30.703
completely cut off from the

00:01:31.136 --> 00:01:32.171
ammunition supply.
&gt;&gt; Completely cut off.

00:01:32.304 --> 00:01:34.340
This is all in just the past few

00:01:34.473 --> 00:01:34.973
days.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.041
Tonight, that big admission that

00:01:36.175 --> 00:01:37.343
nobody seems to care.

00:01:37.476 --> 00:01:39.178
No one is listening.

00:01:39.311 --> 00:01:41.413
Because it does seem clear if

00:01:41.547 --> 00:01:43.849
Putin wanted Wagner to remain a

00:01:43.983 --> 00:01:45.718
priority, things would be

00:01:45.851 --> 00:01:46.218
different.

00:01:46.218 --> 00:01:48.153
Wouldn't be cut off from all the

00:01:48.287 --> 00:01:48.621
phones.

00:01:48.621 --> 00:01:49.355
Putin's regular military has

00:01:49.488 --> 00:01:50.789
been complaining that too much

00:01:51.156 --> 00:01:52.591
has gone to Wagner fighters

00:01:52.725 --> 00:01:53.158
until now.

00:01:53.158 --> 00:01:56.095
Here's a Russian soldier.

00:01:56.228 --> 00:01:57.363
&gt;&gt; Translator: Now all the

00:01:57.496 --> 00:02:00.266
ammunition is going to Wagner

00:02:00.399 --> 00:02:02.735
pmc units who can fire a week's

00:02:03.168 --> 00:02:04.603
worth of ammunition in a day,

00:02:04.737 --> 00:02:06.372
which we can't afford.

00:02:06.505 --> 00:02:09.241
&gt;&gt; So now, you hear it.

00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:11.176
Russian versus Russian in a

00:02:11.176 --> 00:02:12.111
battle for ammunition.

00:02:12.244 --> 00:02:14.213
And it is a remarkable turn of

00:02:14.346 --> 00:02:15.547
events, especially given that

00:02:15.681 --> 00:02:19.184
right now, it is Wagner's flag

00:02:19.318 --> 00:02:23.455
flying in eastern kakhmut, not

00:02:23.589 --> 00:02:23.956
Russia's.

00:02:23.956 --> 00:02:26.692
But the ammunition shortage may

00:02:26.825 --> 00:02:31.730
explain why Putin started

00:02:31.864 --> 00:02:32.364
something suddenly today,

00:02:32.498 --> 00:02:33.532
launching what's been described

00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:35.200
as one of his biggest air

00:02:35.234 --> 00:02:37.202
assaults in months.

00:02:37.202 --> 00:02:39.204
This is almost like a firework

00:02:39.204 --> 00:02:41.206
there going up in the sky.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:43.208
34 missiles were launched

00:02:43.242 --> 00:02:44.576
overnight according to Ukraine.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:47.947
Ukraine intercepted only 34.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.281
At least 11 people have been

00:02:49.415 --> 00:02:49.748
killed.

00:02:49.748 --> 00:02:51.483
It hit a lot of infrastructure.

00:02:51.617 --> 00:02:53.819
Power was knocked out in several

00:02:53.952 --> 00:02:54.253
areas.

00:02:54.253 --> 00:02:56.322
Tonight, Ukraine is bracing for

00:02:56.455 --> 00:02:59.758
another attack.

00:02:59.892 --> 00:03:00.526
Tonight, we're learning the

00:03:00.659 --> 00:03:01.960
United States and its allies

00:03:02.094 --> 00:03:04.863
have now blocked or seized more

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:08.500
than $58 billion from Russian

00:03:08.634 --> 00:03:09.134
oligarchs.

00:03:09.234 --> 00:03:11.236
That's a huge number, but it is

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.238
not a lot relative to how much

00:03:13.238 --> 00:03:13.605
they have.

00:03:13.605 --> 00:03:15.574
To really squeeze the Putin

00:03:15.708 --> 00:03:16.508
insiders, there's much more

00:03:16.642 --> 00:03:17.743
money out there.

00:03:17.876 --> 00:03:22.314
According to Forbes, they have

00:03:22.448 --> 00:03:23.716
83 billion.

00:03:23.849 --> 00:03:25.784
And their collective worth,

00:03:25.918 --> 00:03:27.553
again, not counting the

00:03:27.686 --> 00:03:30.823
uncollected of Putin.

00:03:31.256 --> 00:03:33.759
According to Forbes was about

00:03:33.892 --> 00:03:36.161
$320 billion.

00:03:36.295 --> 00:03:37.730
Alex, with that missile assault

00:03:37.863 --> 00:03:39.965
across the country that you

00:03:40.099 --> 00:03:41.266
heard and saw yourself, what is

00:03:41.266 --> 00:03:42.868
the latest on the ground there?

00:03:43.268 --> 00:03:45.270
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Well, Erin, here

00:03:45.371 --> 00:03:48.741
where we are in the lviv region

00:03:48.874 --> 00:03:51.276
where we saw the highest death

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:52.678
toll, five people killed, and we

00:03:52.811 --> 00:03:55.781
are hearing tonight from

00:03:55.914 --> 00:03:56.615
president zelenskyy speaking

00:03:56.749 --> 00:03:58.317
about the power outages that

00:03:58.450 --> 00:03:59.952
have resulted in the wake of

00:04:00.085 --> 00:04:01.553
this strike, particularly around

00:04:01.687 --> 00:04:04.556
the power plant which has been

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.091
occupied by Russian forces and

00:04:06.225 --> 00:04:07.593
maintained by Ukrainian

00:04:07.726 --> 00:04:08.093
staffers.

00:04:08.093 --> 00:04:10.863
It's the biggest power plant in

00:04:11.296 --> 00:04:16.602
Europe, and it went on to its

00:04:16.735 --> 00:04:17.669
emergency backup generators.

00:04:17.803 --> 00:04:19.371
Zelenskyy accusing them of

00:04:19.505 --> 00:04:20.506
creating such physical

00:04:20.639 --> 00:04:22.975
situations at our nuclear

00:04:23.308 --> 00:04:24.910
facilities as to what Russia

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:26.812
calls a massive retaliation

00:04:26.945 --> 00:04:28.280
strike.

00:04:28.414 --> 00:04:29.314
Fire fighters frantically

00:04:29.448 --> 00:04:31.350
looking for survivors as others

00:04:31.483 --> 00:04:34.720
clear the debris from an

00:04:34.853 --> 00:04:36.622
overnight missile strike in

00:04:36.755 --> 00:04:37.890
Ukraine's lviv renal.

00:04:38.023 --> 00:04:39.491
Falling fragments started a fire

00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:42.127
that destroyed at least three

00:04:42.261 --> 00:04:43.662
residential buildings and left

00:04:43.796 --> 00:04:44.730
at least five people dead.

00:04:44.863 --> 00:04:45.731
According to local authorities,

00:04:45.864 --> 00:04:48.467
the residents were at home.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.969
The victims of Russia's latest

00:04:51.336 --> 00:04:52.671
terrorizing country wide missile

00:04:52.805 --> 00:04:54.673
and drone attacks far from the

00:04:54.807 --> 00:04:55.841
front lines.

00:04:55.974 --> 00:04:57.376
This is horrible.

00:04:57.509 --> 00:04:58.477
I don't know what to say, this

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.946
man said, calling Russians the

00:05:01.346 --> 00:05:03.782
devil.
All across Ukraine, 84 missiles

00:05:03.916 --> 00:05:06.385
were fired and eight drones

00:05:06.518 --> 00:05:07.453
launched at ten different

00:05:07.586 --> 00:05:10.322
regions from lviv in the west to

00:05:10.456 --> 00:05:11.723
the south all the way to donetsk

00:05:11.857 --> 00:05:12.724
in the east.

00:05:12.858 --> 00:05:14.827
The capital of Kyiv, at least

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.295
three people were injured.

00:05:16.428 --> 00:05:18.630
These cars burned out from more

00:05:18.764 --> 00:05:19.898
burning fragments.

00:05:20.032 --> 00:05:24.403
For the first time, Ukraine was

00:05:24.536 --> 00:05:25.370
bombarded with many different

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:26.138
types of missiles, according to

00:05:26.505 --> 00:05:27.639
a spokesman for the air force.

00:05:27.773 --> 00:05:29.875
It was a range of cruise

00:05:30.008 --> 00:05:31.677
missiles launched from the air

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:36.348
and area, including six

00:05:36.482 --> 00:05:37.516
hypersonic missiles as well as

00:05:37.649 --> 00:05:39.852
guided missiles.

00:05:39.985 --> 00:05:41.386
All told at least 11 Ukrainians

00:05:41.386 --> 00:05:43.722
were killed and more than 20

00:05:43.856 --> 00:05:44.189
wounded.

00:05:44.189 --> 00:05:46.525
On Facebook, president zelenskyy

00:05:46.658 --> 00:05:48.327
calls Russia's strikes an

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:49.795
attempt to intimidate Ukrainians

00:05:49.928 --> 00:05:52.097
again, returning to their

00:05:52.231 --> 00:05:54.433
miserable tactics, the occupiers

00:05:54.566 --> 00:05:55.567
can only terrorize.

00:05:55.701 --> 00:05:57.102
That's all they can do, but it

00:05:57.402 --> 00:05:58.971
won't help them.

00:05:59.404 --> 00:06:01.039
Ukrainian officials describe the

00:06:01.406 --> 00:06:03.408
wave of attacks as yet another

00:06:03.408 --> 00:06:07.813
strike on the country's critical

00:06:07.946 --> 00:06:09.715
infrastructure.

00:06:09.848 --> 00:06:11.416
Power was affected, and the

00:06:11.517 --> 00:06:13.418
power plant had to switch to

00:06:13.418 --> 00:06:17.022
diesel generators.

00:06:17.422 --> 00:06:17.890
34 missiles and half the drones

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:18.690
were shot down, but several of

00:06:18.824 --> 00:06:20.926
the types of Russian missiles

00:06:21.059 --> 00:06:23.428
fired can't be taken down with

00:06:23.562 --> 00:06:25.564
Ukraine's current air defenses,

00:06:25.697 --> 00:06:26.331
which the Biden administration

00:06:26.465 --> 00:06:28.133
says they're working to bolster.

00:06:28.267 --> 00:06:29.701
&gt;&gt; Certainly you see there is a

00:06:29.835 --> 00:06:31.436
real air defense need, and

00:06:31.503 --> 00:06:32.804
that's why we're trying to focus

00:06:32.938 --> 00:06:35.440
on the kinds of air defense

00:06:35.507 --> 00:06:36.675
capabilities that the Ukrainians

00:06:36.808 --> 00:06:38.243
really could use to help knock

00:06:38.377 --> 00:06:40.612
down some of these missiles, and

00:06:40.746 --> 00:06:41.780
they were successful in knocking

00:06:41.914 --> 00:06:44.383
down quite a few of these from

00:06:44.516 --> 00:06:45.217
last night.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:46.451
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Russia quickly

00:06:46.585 --> 00:06:47.686
claimed responsibility, calling

00:06:47.819 --> 00:06:49.922
the strikes massive retaliation

00:06:50.055 --> 00:06:52.124
for an alleged cross border

00:06:52.257 --> 00:06:54.560
attack in Russia last week by a

00:06:54.693 --> 00:06:56.628
pro-ukraine group.

00:06:56.762 --> 00:06:59.498
Two Russians were killed, they

00:06:59.631 --> 00:07:01.066
said, but CNN has not confirmed

00:07:01.466 --> 00:07:02.467
the events, which Putin called a

00:07:02.601 --> 00:07:06.271
terrorist attack.

00:07:06.405 --> 00:07:07.940
And tonight, Ukraine's energy

00:07:08.073 --> 00:07:09.808
minister says they are working

00:07:09.942 --> 00:07:11.476
to restore power fully.

00:07:11.476 --> 00:07:13.845
He says they are making good

00:07:13.979 --> 00:07:14.346
progress.

00:07:14.346 --> 00:07:16.448
He praised the energy workers.

00:07:16.582 --> 00:07:19.484
The power is restored in Kyiv,

00:07:19.585 --> 00:07:23.488
but 1/3 of the homes are without

00:07:23.488 --> 00:07:24.356
heat.
Of course, it's very cold here

00:07:24.489 --> 00:07:25.490
in Ukraine in March.

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:27.492
This was, according to the same

00:07:27.593 --> 00:07:30.262
minister, the 15th major strike

00:07:30.395 --> 00:07:35.500
against Ukraine's energy

00:07:35.634 --> 00:07:36.234
infrastructure, and he noted the

00:07:36.368 --> 00:07:36.969
new tactics we saw from Russia

00:07:37.102 --> 00:07:37.903
today, a combination of

